WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:15,380
Father, why don't you let me join the war?

2
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:22,340
I also want to avenge my elder brother

3
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:24,340
The father will come back carrying Chen Haoyu’s head

4
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,840
The country is in crisis

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,140
You are the successor of Jiandao

6
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,140
No need to go into battle in person

7
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,340
In case you are like this

8
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,840
The people from the lower country are cunning and insidious

9
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:38,060
Don't let them take advantage of you, brother

10
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:39,880
You can go with peace of mind

11
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,930
Sister-in-law, I will take good care of you

12
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:44,990
Congratulations to the Second Young Master

13
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:46,490
Congratulations to the Second Young Master

14
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:50,120
Mr. Chang knows things like a god
